WEBVTT

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:03.745
Secure PIN lock screen

00:00:03.746 --> 00:00:08.598
Incoming voice call from Steven

00:00:08.599 --> 00:00:11.067
Decline without unlocking

00:00:11.068 --> 00:00:19.964
Answer a voice call while locked

00:00:19.965 --> 00:00:24.730
Mute and unmute without unlocking

00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:30.065
Hold and resume without unlocking

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:36.070
Choose speaker through Telecom

00:00:36.071 --> 00:00:38.342
Remote caller ends the voice call

00:00:38.343 --> 00:00:42.798
Incoming video call while locked

00:00:42.799 --> 00:00:50.047
Answer video: camera stays off while locked

00:00:50.048 --> 00:01:06.297
Unlock and explicitly enable camera

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:09.311
Lock again: camera pauses

00:01:09.312 --> 00:01:15.310
Unlock: camera resumes

00:01:15.311 --> 00:01:18.740
End call

00:01:18.741 --> 00:01:19.740
Complete
